  "description": {
   "en": "A recent college graduate struggles to find a job that fits his abilities, but one day he is hired by a strange company where all the employees have flashy tattoos. The young man meets the charismatic leader of the group and finds out that he is working for the yakuza.",
   "ja": "就活に失敗した純白な新卒青年・真。そんな彼が“拾われ入社”した会社は、社員全員が刺青を入れているブラック企業だった…!! 一人の青年が『元環状連合』のカリスマリーダーに出会い憧れ、裏社会の“濁り”の中で灰色に染まってゆく……。"
